9. Interview-Level Insights (What Most People Miss)
1. “Why not always use REST?”
REST = real-time but not scalable for bulk
Bulk API is better for large datasets
2. “When to use Platform Events vs Callouts?”
Platform Events → async, scalable, decoupled
Callouts → immediate response needed
3. “How do you handle failures?”
Retry + logging + DLQ + monitoring
4. “How to avoid hitting limits?”
Async processing
Batch processing
Middleware buffering
